  "_provenance": "Output schemas vendored from github/github-mcp-server PR #2468 (rosstarrant/add-output-schema), translated from the Minimal* result types in pkg/github/minimal_types.go. Required = struct fields without `,omitempty`. MinimalUser.details and the get_teams/get_team_members result types are omitted (their shapes are not published in minimal_types.go). The list_* endpoints (list_commits/list_branches/list_tags/list_releases/list_pull_requests/list_issue_types) were reconciled against live server responses (SUB-571): the running server marshals bare arrays, not the wrapper objects PR #2468 declared, so each is a top-level array. search_issues/search_pull_requests were also reconciled live: their handlers marshal the raw github.Issue search result (not a Minimal* type), so item `labels`/`assignees` are object arrays and `milestone` is an object — not the strings PR #2468 declared. The `declared_types_parse_recorded_server_responses` test holds golden server responses asserting these parse. Re-vendor by re-running the translation, then re-check the list_*/search_* shapes against a live server.",
